  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "During a spar in Hu Immortal blessed land, Tai Bai Yun Sheng rapidly rotates the rings against Fang Yuan’s icy drill stardust. Five cloud rings reach their limits and self-detonate one by one; the detonations give him momentum, and he replenishes the five rings while Fang Yuan keeps bombing. Tai Bai Yun Sheng names the move. It cost him two immortal essence stones. Fang Yuan judges it worth that price and says treasure yellow heaven would price it at two and a half immortal essence stones, calling the sale a favor from Inkman King.",
      "chapters": [
        670
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_hu_immortal_blessed_land",
        "char_tai_bai_yun_sheng",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_mo_tan_sang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Tai Bai Yun Sheng carries this cloud path defensive killer move when Fang Yuan sends him toward Eastern Sea.",
      "chapters": [
        673
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "cloud-path-defense",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_eastern_sea"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Among mortal killer moves, it can absorb enemy attacks to a certain degree before counterattacking, and it is valued at two and a half immortal essence stones.",
      "chapters": [
        732
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "market-value",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Tai Bai Yun Sheng had dealings with Northern Plains’ Inkman King, Mo Tan Sang, who sold him this killer move for a low price, which deepened his interest in cloud path.",
      "chapters": [
        750
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "purchase-source",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_northern_plains"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Tai Bai Yun Sheng appears in a room on Snowy Mountain blessed land’s third branch peak, he activates it at almost the same instant, because Fixed Immortal Travel cannot use other Gu worms during the process.",
      "chapters": [
        764
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "arrival-cast",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_snowy_mountain",
        "gu_fixed_immortal_travel",
        "sys_gu_worms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Near a regional wall, formless tides of an earth tide make the move like paper. Tai Bai Yun Sheng says only defensive immortal killer moves have any effect there, even at the periphery.",
      "chapters": [
        820
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "earth-tide",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan, who often spars with Tai Bai Yun Sheng and has grasped his mortal methods, activates this cloud path killer move against Qi Zai. Nine rings of clouds appear around him, block an inferno, and absorb it. Four formerly white rings are dyed red.",
      "chapters": [
        1040
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "southern-border-use",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qi_zai"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Mo Tan Sang recalls that he sold Tai Bai Yun Sheng the nine clouds ring mortal killer move as a favor to befriend them, back when Fang Yuan was still rank six.",
      "chapters": [
        1766
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sale-recalled",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
